          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli makungula lwe ganaatuukanga mwidha kukolanga Ekibinuko eky'Amakungula ag'engaano esooka. Era ku nkomerero ey'omwaka mwidha kukolanga ekibinuko eky'Entindi eky'okusololeza ebirime mu byagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisi musaadha anaabanga n'okwidha okunsinza nze Musengwa Katonda, Katonda owa Isiraeli, mu bibinuko ebyo eby'emikuzi esatu buli mwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kubinga amaghanga agali ye muli kuja, ngaziye ekiketezo kye muja okutyamamu. Era ezira muntu aja kwegomba kutoola itaka lyaimwe, emikuzi egyo esatu buli mwaka, gye munaidhanga okunsinza nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
