          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bw'oghangayo ensolo eitiibwa ng'omusengo ogugheebwayo ku Kibinuko eky'Okwidhukiriraku Okubitizibwa, otaleeterangaku mugaati guzimbulukusiibwa. Era otalekangagho yindi ku mamba ey'ensolo egheereibwayo ng'omusengo n'etuusa enkyo ery'olunaku olwiririra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.25",
